          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.fact",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Children float unsigned worries to a trusted downstream elder. Disagreement: Adults debate whether reading them violates privacy or fulfills the custom. Story use: A paper fleet contains unrelated fears plus one crucial warning.",
