    {
      "entityId": "fact.caldris.dossier.dunmarrow",
      "name": "Polity dossier — Dunmarrow",
      "components": [
        {
          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.fact",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Dunmarrow — iron, peat, and austere kindness. Land and livelihood: cold moors, bog iron, deep mines, peat, hardy sheep, smoked fish, and Rule: King Torren IV shares power uneasily with fortress lords and elected borough provosts. Character: formal hospitality, blunt speech, excellent blankets, competitive funerary hymns, Magic: associated with mine safety, battlefield medicine, old moor traditions, and a small Old wound: northern levies suffered heavily in the Three Banner War and distrust southern Current pressure: ore runs thin while sealed Concord shafts show new airflow.",
